{"title": "Manipur Musician Beaten to Death in Delhi; Eight Arrested", "summary": "A 54-year-old musician from Manipur was beaten to death in Delhi's Kilokari village on Monday. The incident occurred after the musician objected to a group of eight people creating a nuisance outside his home. All eight individuals have been arrested by the police.", "summary_points": ["A 54-year-old musician from Manipur was killed in Delhi.", "The musician reportedly objected to a group creating a nuisance outside his home.", "Eight people have been arrested in connection with the incident.", "The incident took place in Kilokari village."], "title_hi": "मणिपुर के संगीतकार की दिल्ली में पीट-पीटकर हत्या; आठ गिरफ्तार", "summary_hi": "मणिपुर के 54 वर्षीय संगीतकार की सोमवार को दिल्ली के किलोकड़ी गांव में पीट-पीटकर हत्या कर दी गई। यह घटना तब हुई जब संगीतकार ने आठ लोगों के एक समूह द्वारा उसके घर के बाहर हंगामा करने पर आपत्ति जताई थी। पुलिस ने सभी आठ आरोपियों को गिरफ्तार कर लिया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["मणिपुर के 54 वर्षीय संगीतकार की दिल्ली में हत्या कर दी गई।", "संगीतकार ने कथित तौर पर एक समूह द्वारा उसके घर के बाहर हंगामा करने पर आपत्ति जताई थी।", "इस घटना के संबंध में आठ लोगों को गिरफ्तार किया गया है।", "यह घटना किलोकड़ी गांव में हुई।"], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized the incident as a mob lynching.", "Mentioned the former Manipur Chief Minister's expression of deep sadness."], "center": ["The coverage highlights the victim's origin from Manipur and the location of the incident in Delhi.", "Both reports emphasize the number of arrests made (eight individuals)."], "right": ["Focused on the Northeast community being on edge after the killing.", "Identified the accused as delivery boys."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["घटना को मॉब लिंचिंग के रूप में जोर दिया गया।", "मणिपुर के पूर्व मुख्यमंत्री द्वारा गहरा दुख व्यक्त करने का उल्लेख किया गया।"], "center": ["कवरेज में पीड़ित के मणिपुर से होने और घटना के दिल्ली में घटित होने पर प्रकाश डाला गया है।", "दोनों रिपोर्टों में की गई गिरफ्तारियों की संख्या (आठ व्यक्ति) पर जोर दिया गया है।"], "right": ["हत्या के बाद पूर्वोत्तर समुदाय के तनाव में होने पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया गया।", "आरोपी की पहचान डिलीवरी बॉय के रूप में की गई।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.tribuneindia.com/sortd-service/imaginary/v22-01/jpg/large/high?url=dGhldHJpYnVuZS1zb3J0ZC1wcm8tcHJvZC1zb3J0ZC9tZWRpYTcwODIyOGYwLWFiMTQtMTFmMS05YjIwLTgzZThkYzhhYjE2YS5qcGc=", "sources": [{"source": "Mathrubhumi English", "owner": "Mathrubhumi English", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Manipuri musician beaten to death after objecting to drinking outside Delhi home; 8 held"}, {"source": "Times Now", "owner": "Times Now", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOV3RZUldtQ1E1anlVeWZBdkczaVBLc0ZLX3BsTDlpd1lRbFpReUt5ZDgxYnFTM2puS1FoelhoRDAxMUFTMnJZMEl6eThISzBnQlRveEZGZDNVYl9fcldmbG9Ud1Qtc2dmbWMyY0NHb2ZBTER1WktmUFU3RzhNbm0yMkRSMWhHUU84U0RVbG9BVGhicldVWUk0Rkhfbk9jYkNSV2t4UUFkV3hwZzlWNU4wdTlzeVgydm9YRDUtelJxTQ?oc=5", "headline": "Northeast Community On Edge After Manipuri Guitarist's Killing In Delhi"}, {"source": "The Tribune", "owner": "The Tribune", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/delhi/manipur-musician-beaten-to-death-in-delhi-8-land-in-police-net", "headline": "Manipur musician beaten to death in Delhi , 8 land in police net"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/delhi/gifted-guitarist-who-built-his-life-around-music-in-delhi-over-20-yrs-tragic-end-for-bafta-winning-manipuri-film-directors-cousin/articleshow/133904050.cms", "headline": "Gifted Manipuri musician beaten to death for objecting to noise outside Delhi home"}, {"source": "Scroll.in", "owner": "Scroll.in", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": 